  "title": "Consciousness is three conditions satisfied at once",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "622c2d5b-f861-493d-92ba-eb9ef6c36f53",
      "text": "Consciousness is the simultaneous satisfaction of genealogical continuity (the entity persists as itself, its present derived from its own past), structural invariance (a form of its own that holds across contexts) and functional consequence (what it does changes what it is). No one alone is enough.",
